    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700103/7017001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001030040,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ん？　どうしたんすか？　プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700103/7017001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、今回はちゃんと喜んでくれたみたいだから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001030050,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "だって、嬉しいっすから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700103/7017001030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001030060,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "いてもたってもいられないっす！\r\nまだまだ楽しいことがあるってことっすよね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700103/7017001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……\r\n確かにこれから先、たくさん機会はある",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、その分厳しい戦いにもなる\r\n気を抜かずに行こう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001030070,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "はいっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700103/7017001030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001030080,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あ、でもプロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700103/7017001030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001030090,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "その分すごい人たちに出会えるってことっすよね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700103/7017001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろんそうなるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001030100,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "あはは、ワクワクしてきたっす！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700103/7017001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7017001030110,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "早く色んな人のパフォーマンスが見てみたいっす！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701700103/7017001030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、楽しみにしてくれて何よりだ",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
